  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The standard electrode potential <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>o</mo></msup></math> and its temperature coefficient&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi>dE</mi><mi>dT</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math> for a cell are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>&#215;10</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8201;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300&#8201;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, respectively. The reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math>. The standard reaction enthalpy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is&nbsp;</p><p><math><mo>[</mo></math>Use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=96,500&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math></p>"
